            <title>[LU-21032] recovery-small test_130a, test_130b: mkdir -i2 fails with EIO after test 113 evicts MDT0002 osp from MDT0000</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21032</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;recovery-small test_130a and test_130b fail with EIO on 'lfs mkdir -i2 -c1 -H crush2/all_char' in review-dne-zfs-part-5 (zfs, 4 MDTs, 2 MDS), right after test 113.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test 113 sets fail_loc=0x80000157 (OBD_FAIL_MDS_LDLM_REPLY_NET) on the MDS nodes for about 60s. MDS-MDS and LWP connections lose their replies in that window. On the MDS (onyx-158vm132), as 130a starts, the log shows:&lt;br/&gt;
  lustre-MDT0000: Received MDS connection from 10.240.24.85@tcp, removing former export from 10.240.24.46@tcp&lt;br/&gt;
  lustre-MDT0000-osp-MDT0002: operation out_update to node 0@lo failed: rc = -107&lt;br/&gt;
  lustre-MDT0000-osp-MDT0002: This client was evicted by lustre-MDT0000&lt;br/&gt;
  osp_attr_get() lustre-MDT0000-osp-MDT0002: osp_attr_get update error &lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;0x200000007:0x1:0x0&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;: rc = -5&lt;br/&gt;
The same eviction of the MDT0002 osp import happens at the start of 130b. A mkdir -i2 needs MDT0002 to talk to MDT0000, so it returns EIO.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test 113 only checks client connections (lfs df) after clearing the fail_loc, so the MDT-MDT imports can still be recovering when the next test starts. The failure is a test ordering race, not a code bug: tests that stripe a directory onto another MDT should wait for MDT-MDT connections after test 113 (for example wait_osp_active or similar).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen once in 4424 recovery-small runs over 30 days (rate 0.0002), on change 64546 patchset 12, whose diff touches only llapi nodemap code. Failing test sets: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/7e9ef4c7-5cd2-47d8-88df-99a35f75f224" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/7e9ef4c7-5cd2-47d8-88df-99a35f75f224&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-64546-ps12-ed91af769c9d on &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/64546" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/64546&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
